      "dc:source": "crimes-act-1914.pdf, p.277",
      "skos:note": "A summons under this section shall be served in the same manner as a summons to a witness to appear before a court of summary jurisdiction in the State or Territory where the summons under this section is issued. Refusal to provide evidence under prescribed authority is penalized.",
